OL,4,G1345FWhen I Met Jane Austen
OL,5,     GAs Jane Austen turns 250, writer
OL,6,     GDr Paula Byrne is joined by
OL,7,     Gprominent writers and thinkers
OL,8,     Gwho reveal their memorable
OL,9,     Gencounters with the famous
OL,10,     Gauthor. Today, Amy Heckerling.
OL,11,G1400FThe Archers
OL,12,     GPat offers some pearls of wisdom,
OL,13,     Gand there's tractor trouble at
OL,14,     GBridge Farm.
OL,15,G1415FTrust
OL,16,     GYvette reflects on a secret she's
OL,17,     Gkept for over a decade, as staff
OL,18,     Gare forced to think creatively to
OL,19,     Gfill the school hall for the
OL,20,     Gcareers fair.
